WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.752 --> 00:00:01.473
Wow! Who are you?

2
00:00:01.513 --> 00:00:02.833
I'm a Komodo dragon.

3
00:00:02.853 --> 00:00:03.333
We are lizards.

4
00:00:31.244 --> 00:00:31.724
You're really big!

5
00:00:31.744 --> 00:00:33.645
We can grow up to three meters long.

6
00:00:35.526 --> 00:00:39.067
We can weigh over 140 kilograms.

7
00:00:41.729 --> 00:00:44.270
We're the biggest lizards in the world.

8
00:00:47.031 --> 00:00:48.051
Where do you live?

9
00:00:49.932 --> 00:00:52.933
We live on islands in Indonesia.

10
00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:58.476
The islands have forests, beaches, and grasslands.

11
00:01:00.672 --> 00:01:03.915
We like to stay in the forest and grasslands.

12
00:01:06.317 --> 00:01:07.458
What do you eat?

13
00:01:09.559 --> 00:01:11.341
We eat almost anything.

14
00:01:14.684 --> 00:01:17.446
Snakes and birds are tasty meals for us.

15
00:01:19.748 --> 00:01:23.511
We also like goats, monkeys, deer, and pigs.

16
00:01:26.634 --> 00:01:29.016
Huh? How can you eat a big deer?

17
00:01:30.676 --> 00:01:33.697
We can open our jaws really wide.

18
00:01:37.138 --> 00:01:39.239
Plus our teeth are sharp.

19
00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:44.420
How do you catch your meals?

20
00:01:45.881 --> 00:01:48.181
Komodo dragons are good at hiding.

21
00:01:50.482 --> 00:01:53.483
We hide and wait for animals to pass.

22
00:01:55.004 --> 00:01:56.064
Then we attack.

23
00:01:59.148 --> 00:02:00.830
You look like a dragon!

24
00:02:02.972 --> 00:02:04.973
Our tongues are shaped like forks.

25
00:02:09.417 --> 00:02:11.439
And they are yellow, like fire.

26
00:02:14.502 --> 00:02:15.102
It's hot.

27
00:02:17.505 --> 00:02:19.466
I'm going to nap in the shade.

28
00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:25.211
Good-bye, Komodo dragon!
